# Skills directory
/skills/upload/

# Reference copy of the retired Python/Vite app. Kept locally for porting
# (OCR + document intelligence), never part of this repo.
Archieve - Do not touch/

# Runtime document storage (STORAGE_DIR). Uploaded PDFs never belong in git.
/storage/

# Provider-specific Prisma schemas, generated by scripts/schema-for.mjs from
# prisma/schema.prisma. Build artefacts — the source schema is the SQLite one.
/prisma/schema.sqlite.prisma
/prisma/schema.postgresql.prisma

# graphify knowledge graph. Only the readable artefacts are tracked: the report
# and the interactive graph, so the map is browsable on GitHub without a local
# build. graph.json (16MB) and cache/ (15MB) are rebuildable derived data that
# would rewrite whole on every rebuild and bloat history permanently.
#
# The query commands (god-nodes, affected, explain, path, query) read
# graph.json, so run `graphify update .` once per clone before using them
# (~1 min, AST-only, no API cost).
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!graphify-out/graph.html

/prisma/sqlite/schema.prisma
/prisma/postgresql/schema.prisma
/e2e/remediation/.compiled/
